# S08-T07: Legacy Totem Path Fallback

## Objective

Forks without in-repo planning dirs still work via env / legacy walk.

## Implementation

- [ ] If `apps/{targetApp}/planning/sprints/` missing AND `WORK_CONTROL_TOTEM_PATH` set → use external
- [ ] If missing AND legacy `../../totem/.../app-agent` exists → use external (log warn: deprecated)
- [ ] `.env.example`: document `WORK_CONTROL_PLANNING_ROOT`, deprecate note on `WORK_CONTROL_TOTEM_PATH`
- [ ] Unit test: fallback chain order per S08-INVARIANTS

## Done when

- [ ] Tests cover in-repo preferred + legacy fallback
- [ ] No silent failure when neither path exists — clear error message
